```handlebars
<form>
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Nome</label>
    <input name="name" type="text" value="{{name}}" />
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Caminho alvo (Target)</label>
    <input
      name="targetPath"
      type="text"
      value="{{targetPath}}"
      placeholder="ex.: system.skills.athletics.item"
    />
    <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#666;margin-top:6px;">Comece a digitar
      para ver sugestões (atributos, perícias, defesas)</div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Valor</label>
    <input name="value" type="number" step="1" value="{{value}}" />
  </div>
</form>